  (text "k0d3ball36 trackball sensor board, PMW3610DM-SUDU + LM18-LSI lens.\nVDDIO and all logic run at 3.3 V straight from the main PCB (no level shifters).\nVDD 1.8 V is generated on board by U2.  MOTION is push-pull; R3 limits current if the\nFFC is inserted the wrong way round.  R2 keeps the sensor deselected while the host boots." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 170 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "58f17ec4-fd35-43fc-8704-094f79d938ba"))
  (text "FPC pin order on THIS board: 1 MOT, 2 NCS, 3 SDIO, 4 SCLK, 5 GND, 6 VCC.\nMain PCB order: 1 VCC, 2 GND, 3 SCLK, 4 SDIO, 5 NCS, 6 MOT.\nBoth connectors are bottom-contact parts on the component side of their boards and are\njoined by a same-side-contact (type A) FFC, which mirrors the pin order end to end." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30 185 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f6149b11-04ee-4b40-a317-8c8e56cd5385"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
  (embedded_fonts no)
)
